Package: com.itsallexb.splitviewenabler
Name: SplitViewEnabler (iOS 12)
Version: 2.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Enables Split View (and Slide Over on top of Split View) on iPads that Apple limited to Slide Over, such as the iPad mini 2, on iOS 12. Settings > Split View.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0), preferenceloader
